{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26313","headline":"効古兴 · 施肩吾","name":"効古兴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金雀无旧钗，缃绮无旧裾。\n唯有一寸心，长贮万里夫。\n南轩夜虫织已促，北牖飞蛾遶残烛。\n祗言衆口铄千金，谁信独愁销片玉。\n不知岁晚归不归，又将啼眼缝征衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"施肩吾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26313.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26313","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}